phẩm chất lượng cao, bền bỉ c&ugrave;ng với thời gian..</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:14px;">***B&aacute;nh xe con lăn nhựa &eacute;p v&ograve;ng bi - d&ograve;ng sản phẩm CHẤT LƯỢNG CAO!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:14px;">- Th&ocirc;ng tin chi tiết b&aacute;nh xe con lăn nhựa &eacute;p v&ograve;ng bi</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:14px;">- Vật liệu: Nhựa PA nguy&ecirc;n sinh , V&ograve;ng bi bạc đạn 6000rs</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:14px;">- K&iacute;ch thước: Phi 40mm x dầy 20mm, đường k&iacute;nh v&ograve;ng bi 10mm</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:14px;">- Trọng lượng: 40g</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px;">*Th&ocirc;ng tin li&ecirc;n hệ: call/zalo: 090 456 9683 *** 0983 81 2311</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px;">&nbsp; website:&nbsp;<a href="http://nhuatkg.com/?fbclid=IwAR1Id7o4goHIG56iNfvM1oPo1oXD64XXbsHjH5EnhUgL5WlaQVc7RMfeOoM" rel="nofollow noopener" role="link" tabindex="0" target="_blank">nhuatkg.com</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px;">&nbsp; Nh&agrave; m&aacute;y sản xuất: Cụm c&ocirc;ng nghiệp Li&ecirc;n Phương- Thường T&iacute;n- H&agrave; Nội.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/nhua-cong-nghiep/kich-thuoc-42-6000c.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 525px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/nhua-cong-nghiep/kich-thuoc-42-6000v.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 525px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/nhua-cong-nghiep/trang-3.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 500px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/nhua-cong-nghiep/trang-4.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 498px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/nhua-cong-nghiep/trang-5.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 506px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/nhua-cong-nghiep/trang-6.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 492px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/nhua-cong-nghiep/trang-7.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 500px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/nhua-cong-nghiep/trang-8.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 500px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/nhua-cong-nghiep/trang-9.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 500px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/nhua-cong-nghiep/trang-10.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 500px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/nhua-cong-nghiep/trang-1.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 500px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '', 0, 3718, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1, 0, 'Bánh xe con lăn nhựa', 'Bánh xe con lăn nhựa ', 'Bánh xe con lăn nhựa ', 7, 7, '2022-04-12 13:25:18', '2025-04-17 06:03:35');
