(107, 0, 0, '', 'Hộp đựng hạt điều nặng 200g', 'hop-dung-hat-dieu-nang-200g', 'hop-dung-hat-dieu-nang-200g', '', 1, '["1","18","21"]', '/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/hop-nhua-trong-suot/td18/td18.jpg', '[{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td18\\/td18.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td18\\/td18-1a.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td18\\/td18-7.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td18\\/z4940924625678-bfb979052fec9936aa705a1da8d43ae4.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td18\\/z4940924633238-5b4254dd6f76d169ff1918894cdfb169.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td18\\/md-2023-01-06-07-32-21-0700-xegrjnsvfh.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td18\\/1.jfif","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td18\\/td18-kt.jpg","title":"","description":""}]', 'TD18', 0, 10000, 12500, 0, 0, 0, '<p>Hộp tr&ograve;n trong suốt 200g- TD18 Xếp 2 h&agrave;ng hạt điều</p>\r\n', '<p><span style="font-size:20px;"><strong>Hộp tr&ograve;n trong suốt 200g- TD18 Xếp 2 h&agrave;ng hạt điều</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>K&iacute;ch thước: cao 50&nbsp;x Phi 150mm</li>\r\n	<li>cao l&ograve;ng trong : 42mm- xếp được 2 h&agrave;ng hạt điều&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Tổng trọng lượng: Hộp + hạt = 500g&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;*&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Dầy: 0.4mm</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Vật liệu : Nhựa GPPS nguy&ecirc;n sinh</li>\r\n	<li>M&agr