(124, 0, 0, '', 'Hộp đựng hạt điều 200g TD10', 'hop-dung-hat-dieu-200g-td10', 'hop-dung-hat-dieu-200g-td10', '', 1, '["1","18","21"]', '/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/hop-nhua-trong-suot/td10/td10.jpg', '[{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td10\\/td10a.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td10\\/td10-4.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td10\\/td10-3.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td10\\/td10-2.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td10\\/td10b.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td10\\/td10-1.jpg","title":"","description":""},{"images":"\\/uploads\\/images\\/san-pham-nhua\\/hop-nhua-trong-suot\\/td10\\/td10-kt.jpg","title":"","description":""}]', 'td10', 0, 10000, 12500, 0, 12500, 0, '', '<p><span style="color:#c0392b;"><span style="font-size:20px;"><strong>Hộp tr&ograve;n trong suốt 200g - xếp 3 h&agrave;ng hạt điều</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>K&iacute;ch thước: cao 56&nbsp;x Phi 145mm</li>\r\n	<li>cao l&ograve;ng trong : 50mm- xếp được 3&nbsp;h&agrave;ng hạt điều&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Tổng trọng lượng: Hộp + hạt = 500g&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;*&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Dầy: 0.4mm</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Vật liệu : Nhựa GPPS nguy&ecirc;n sinh</li>\r\n	<li>M&agrave;u: Trong suốt</li>\r\n	<li>Trọng lượng: 20<strong>0g</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="/uploads/images/san-pham-nhua/hop-nhua-trong-suot/td10/td10.jpg" style="width: 800px; height: 800px;" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt="" src="